WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.030
Photos shows every picture and video your child's educators have shared, newest first.

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:12.240
If you have more than one child, tap a name to see their photos.

3
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:19.530
Tap a photo to see it full size. Use the arrows, or swipe, to move to the next one.

4
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:28.580
To keep a photo, tap Download. Please remember that other children may be in the picture before you share it outside KiddieTrac.

5
00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.260
Tap the cross to close the photo and go back to the gallery.
